<section class="module-landing-banner mb-5" style="--hero-bg: url('../images/heroes/hero-hospital.jpg');" aria-label="Introduction">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="module-landing-accent" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p class="module-landing-kicker mb-2">Healthcare Management</p>
        <h1 class="module-landing-headline text-white mb-3">Enterprise Hospital & Clinic Management Systems.</h1>
        <p class="module-landing-dek mb-4 col-lg-10 px-0">
            A high-standard clinical and administrative operating system for modern healthcare 
            facilities—digitizing the patient journey from first triage to final discharge 
            and medical aid reconciliation.
        </p>
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <a href="#components" class="btn btn-light btn-sm px-4 fw-semibold">Module components</a>
            <a href="/#inquiry" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-sm px-4">Start a conversation</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<div class="row mb-5" id="components">

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Module Components</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
            Our healthcare suite integrates all clinical and supporting departments into a unified 
            Electronic Medical Record (EMR) framework.
        </p>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/hospital/dashboard">Dashboard</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Real-time monitoring of bed occupancy, outpatient volumes, medication stock levels, 
                    and clinical outcomes across the facility.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/hospital/registration">Patient Registration</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Master Patient Index (MPI) with demographics capture, medical aid verification, 
                    and biometric identification for high-integrity patient tracking.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/hospital/outpatient">Outpatient (OPD)</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Streamlined consultation workflows, triage-based queue management, and digital 
                    prescribing linked to the EMR and Pharmacy.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/hospital/inpatient">Inpatient & Wards</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Comprehensive ward management, bed tracking, nursing observations, and discharge 
                    documentation for inpatient care cycles.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/hospital/medicalrecords">EMR & Clinical Dossier</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Longitudinal health records, diagnosis coding (ICD-10), allergy tracking, 
                    and historical document archival for every patient.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/hospital/laboratory">Laboratory (LIS)</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    End-to-end test management from order creation and sample labeling to results 
                    entry and critical value clinician alerts.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/hospital/pharmacy">Pharmacy Management</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Secure prescription fulfillment, stock control with expiry monitoring, and 
                    integration with the central billing core.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/hospital/radiology">Radiology (RIS)</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Imaging order workflow, technician worklists, and results archival. Integration 
                    with standard imaging protocols for centralized review.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/hospital/billing">Billing & Medical Aid</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Multi-currency patient billing, automated medical aid claim generation, 
                    and reconciliation with Zimbabwe's leading health insurers.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">The Unified Patient Journey</h2>
        <p>
            Place the patient at the center of your operations with a core system that eliminates 
            clinical silos. From the moment a patient registers at the front desk, their 
            data flows seamlessly through triage, consultation, investigation (Lab/Radiology), 
            and treatment. Our Master Patient Index (MPI) ensures that every clinical event 
            is linked to the correct individual, providing doctors with a complete, 
            longitudinal view of the patient's health history, regardless of which 
            department they visit.
        </p>
        <p>
            High-integrity biometric identification options (fingerprint scanning) provide an 
            additional layer of security, particularly valuable for high-volume public 
            clinics and specialized care programs where accurate patient tracking is 
            mission-critical.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Clinical Precision & Decision Support</h2>
        <p>
            Empower your clinicians with tools built for speed and accuracy. The Outpatient (OPD) 
            and Inpatient modules utilize standardized consultation formats (SOAP) and 
            integrated ICD-10 diagnosis coding, ensuring that clinical records are 
            always thorough and compliant with international standards. Digital 
            prescribing alerts doctors to potential drug-drug interactions or known 
            patient allergies in real-time, significantly reducing the risk of 
            medication errors.
        </p>
        <p>
            Nursing observation charts and ward round documentation are captured digitally, 
            providing a clear, timestamped record of care that is accessible to the 
            entire authorized clinical team, eliminating the risks associated with 
            unreadable paper notes.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Technical Investigative Ecosystem</h2>
        <p>
            Accelerate diagnosis through a deeply integrated Laboratory (LIS) and Radiology (RIS) 
            workflow. Test orders are transmitted instantly from the consultation room to 
            the lab, with automated sample labeling to prevent errors. Results are 
            filed back into the patient's EMR as soon as they are approved by the 
            technician, with immediate "critical value" alerts sent to the requesting 
            clinician's dashboard for urgent cases.
        </p>
        <p>
            Pharmacy stock control is managed with granular precision, tracking every tablet 
            from the warehouse to the patient's bedside, with automated alerts for 
            low stock levels or upcoming expiry dates, ensuring that essential 
            medications are always available when needed.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Financial Health & Revenue Cycle</h2>
        <p>
            Protect the facility's financial sustainability through rigorous billing and medical 
            aid management. The system automatically captures billable events (consultations, 
            tests, medications, ward stays) as they occur in the clinical workflow, 
            generating multi-currency invoices for private patients and automated 
            claims for medical aid societies. Native integration with CIMAS, PSMAS, 
            and Premier ensures that claims are formatted correctly for rapid 
            reconciliation.
        </p>
        <p>
            Strategic DHIS2 integration streamlines the process of statutory health reporting to 
            the Ministry of Health, ensuring that your facility remains a compliant 
            and contributing member of the national healthcare network.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

